{
  "about": "LiteOS system icons: a role name (what the icon stands for) to its file in this set, as \"category/name\" (or \"category/size/name\" for a file outside the category's size). Light and dark come from the folder for the OS theme, at the category's size below; a role can also be asked for as its monochrome -symbolic variant where the set has one. Read by App\\Support\\SystemIcons (PHP) and LOS_sysIcon (JS). The glass.* roles are light icons for dark glass surfaces (the sign-in and lock screens), the same in both themes. In-app toolbar icons are not system icons and are not listed here.",
